ind":"announcement","title":"Sticky Rooms is taking part in Steam Next Fest","summary":"From October 19 to 26, the Sticky Rooms: A hopeful illusion demo is available as part of Steam Next Fest.Furniture in this game comes as stickers. You place it on the room and there it stays: put the table down before the rug and the rug no longer fits underneath. There’s no undo. Every job is a small puzzle of order, with a client who has their own demands and an invoice at the end that grades how well you did.The demo covers Clara’s first jobs plus free mode, where you decorate your own home w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:52:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692873","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4849440-1841579228679776","game_id":"steam-4849440","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo now available!","summary":"ContentsThe first five commissions, playable in fullAccess to My Home, where you can decorate your own apartment using the furniture and money you've earned across those commissionsBoth English and Spanish, text and UIHow the game worksFurniture pieces are stickers. Placement is permanent, and anything placed later sits on top of what came before, put a rug down after a table and the table is covered. There's no undo.This makes placement order the central puzzle. Clients set a furniture target a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T21:50:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228679776","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:49:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4849440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:25Z","error_cod